   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1ea67e0b2d52a9c8a050",
   "sourceHash": "1ea67e0b2d52a9c8a0508d4af300abdd13a1e8b8882ca413904a73087058d3af",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]ドーシャ（ヴァータ、ピッタ、カパ）のバランスを整えます",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bb52d41f4fe7ecc90467",
   "sourceHash": "bb52d41f4fe7ecc904670463f9e74d72bb889c9e95eb80a2fa414703c29b137c",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]心の明晰さと集中力を高めます",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_597788db5db4135d801d",
   "sourceHash": "597788db5db4135d801d1530d131f839fd089e2cf415d7896ade4b79b8875b64",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]ホルモンバランスをサポートします",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_708a28ff976c28328adb",
   "sourceHash": "708a28ff976c28328adbc2dbf61f9085d4a3a50ec317f77e286691736bce97a3",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]消化と代謝を改善します",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_abe48fda5882cbc5f955",
   "sourceHash": "abe48fda5882cbc5f955b441e2245d750784aa8d93258aade60356f46e12fa65",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]心の回復を促します",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_39cf8bee52ee6c9b7fde",
   "sourceHash": "39cf8bee52ee6c9b7fdec03e823534130f00d87bb1736d7fa798115e6813c697",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]より健康的な生活習慣を後押しします",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_25e8fa51d089a8e44d31",
   "sourceHash": "25e8fa51d089a8e44d31bc8bdf11b2137e7db2c6bbfc2bade4cb51cd81765c54",
   "text": "睡眠薬を服用している場合や睡眠時無呼吸症候群がある場合でも、このプログラムは役立ちますか？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d0e775cb2d1d3d86da9c",
   "sourceHash": "d0e775cb2d1d3d86da9c1037aed15af650ef0d3ccf4a6f94a4f39bd6c325d15f",
   "text": "睡眠回復療法 – ニドラ Chikitsa（チキツァ）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source lacks a separator between the English name and 'Nidra Chikitsa'; a dash was inserted."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_29250f74cb202038b265",
   "sourceHash": "29250f74cb202038b265993a43cecafc164ec6d024f86386aeb3745b60f9b02d",
   "text": "Kairali The Ayurvedic Healing Village の睡眠回復療法",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5a24db0be40fe3c8dc5e",
   "sourceHash": "5a24db0be40fe3c8dc5e6553ed10c872e073c7835dffe9990dac555792b48edb",
   "text": "Kairali で、緑色のリネンの服を着てマットの上であぐらをかき瞑想する患者さん",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4a578e5bfae1c6454823",
   "sourceHash": "4a578e5bfae1c64548237ad8fd7dee0d356fb689450462f12e87b1ff6f0f5955",
   "text": "Kairali の療法室で、緑色のバナナの葉を頭に巻き、クリーム色の綿のローブを着て座っている患者さん",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_20eb6e2278e677ee4e18",
   "sourceHash": "20eb6e2278e677ee4e187358150c75ab9b924f59b020cee5c9dae0da010d448a",
   "text": "治療に用いる療法には、アビヤンガ、ナスヤ、シローダーラ、タクラダーラ、タポーティチル、シローヴァスティが含まれます。これらは体質と医師の診察に基づいて行われます。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Therapy names transliterated into katakana; 'thapotichil' transliterated phonetically as it has no established Japanese form."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9c126d6bb90b278e9d83",
   "sourceHash": "9c126d6bb90b278e9d83143f27ddf0d7d55fbb2d5bfbcc3cd0d28af22c2630d4",
   "text": "不眠症、または寝つきが悪い",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2629cf2c7c6cf616ad8e",
   "sourceHash": "2629cf2c7c6cf616ad8ed0c2c6f16436a6ca81fc0a2a84c9b8f10c8470e7bf75",
   "text": "睡眠が途切れる、または眠りが浅く乱れる",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_30f0efe2005c91326dbd",
   "sourceHash": "30f0efe2005c91326dbdb1b931515817a12ae5417e3cc9a0036a47923ecb876a",
   "text": "過度のストレス、不安、または精神的な疲労",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a3c12035dedc6bdeb922",
   "sourceHash": "a3c12035dedc6bdeb922626456299e386d61de98eb03fdd09ce58362ac559b0a",
   "text": "睡眠時無呼吸、または睡眠中の浅い呼吸",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e36918ece29916da6524",
   "sourceHash": "e36918ece29916da6524851a675ee1ea67899606698f1fb888c06a94b882e6be",
   "text": "時差ぼけや頻繁な移動による睡眠の乱れ",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5c80d3512f42f39922c8",
   "sourceHash": "5c80d3512f42f39922c8d83fd1923106501808fcdd626b18ee4c679c63b45d95",
   "text": "更年期やホルモンバランスの乱れに関連する睡眠障害",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b4e928b5cd3732af8b0f",
   "sourceHash": "b4e928b5cd3732af8b0f3b06f8b5fd3e3222e724076de1fe54d7486207fe12aa",
   "text": "夜間の考えすぎ、落ち着かなさ、または次々と浮かぶ考え",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
